---
import CaseLayout from '../layouts/CaseLayout.astro';
---
<CaseLayout
  title="B Smart Glasses by Lenskart · Deepali Pathe"
  caseNum="01"
  caseName="B Smart Glasses"
>
  <main class="page">
    <div class="wrap">

      <!-- Hero -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow">
          <span class="num">01</span><span>·</span><span>2026</span><span>·</span><span>Lenskart · Product Design</span>
          <span class="nda">NDA · Overview only</span>
        </div>
        <p class="page-sub">What actually deserves to be in your line of sight all day?</p>
        <h1 class="page-title"><em>B</em> <span class="accent">Smart</span> <em>Glasses.</em></h1>
        <p class="page-lede">
          I designed the companion app for India's first smart glasses by Lenskart. The hardest part was not the features — it was helping people use something they had <em>never seen before.</em>
        </p>
        <div class="role-badges">
          <span class="role-badge">End-to-End Design</span>
          <span class="role-badge">Voice UX</span>
          <span class="role-badge">Onboarding</span>
          <span class="role-badge">0 → 1 Product</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="page-meta reveal">
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Client</span><span class="v">Lenskart</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Role</span><span class="v">Product Designer · End-to-end</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Type</span><span class="v">0 → 1 · Smart wearable</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Year</span><span class="v">2026</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cover reveal">
        <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dfim5nugc/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_900,c_limit/thumb-smartglasses_znjqz4" alt="B Smart Glasses by Lenskart" />
      </div>

      <!-- 01 Role -->
      <section class="section reveal">
        <div class="section-label"><span class="num">01</span><span>My role</span></div>
        <h2 class="section-h">I didn't just design screens. <span class="accent">I owned the experience.</span></h2>
        <ol class="num-list">
          <li><span class="n">01</span><span>Led design from start to finish, for the companion app for smart glasses.</span></li>
          <li><span class="n">02</span><span>Made it easy for people who have never tried smart glasses before.</span></li>
          <li><span class="n">03</span><span>Owned the first-time setup, Buddy (the voice assistant), and every main flow inside the app.</span></li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <!-- 02 Context -->
      <section class="section reveal">
        <div class="section-label"><span class="num">02</span><span>The starting point</span></div>
        <h2 class="section-h">Ray-Ban Meta was already out there. <em>People had expectations.</em></h2>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>We weren't inventing a brand new thing. But we were building it for an Indian market that had never worn a tiny computer on their face. The hard question was: <em>how do you teach someone a product they have no mental picture for?</em></p>
        </div>
        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stat"><div class="k">Project type</div><div class="v accent">0 → 1</div><div class="sub">A brand new category</div></div>
          <div class="stat"><div class="k">Research</div><div class="v">NDA</div><div class="sub">Details under wraps</div></div>
          <div class="stat"><div class="k">User base</div><div class="v accent">Zero</div><div class="sub">No one had used this before</div></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 03 Product -->
      <section class="section reveal">
        <div class="section-label"><span class="num">03</span><span>What I built</span></div>
        <h2 class="section-h">Four parts of the <em>experience.</em></h2>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>Pairing, gallery, voice, settings — the app does it all. The real question was never "what features", it was <strong>"how do we keep it from feeling like too much?"</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="product-grid">
          <div class="product-card">
            <span class="pn">01 · Gallery</span>
            <span class="ps">The screen people open the most</span>
            <h4>Capture, view, return</h4>
            <p>Photos and videos in one place. No menus to dig through. The thing you use daily should be one tap away.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="product-card">
            <span class="pn">02 · Buddy · Voice AI</span>
            <span class="ps">Not a command. A conversation.</span>
            <h4>A voice that feels human</h4>
            <p>When to listen. How to reply. How much to say. Even "Say Hey Buddy" had to feel easy, not awkward.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="product-card">
            <span class="pn">03 · Control Hub</span>
            <span class="ps">The app as a bridge</span>
            <h4>Settings without overwhelm</h4>
            <p>Controls for the glasses. The hard part was not adding features — it was making sure nothing felt heavy.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="product-card">
            <span class="pn">04 · Tutorials</span>
            <span class="ps">The big unlock</span>
            <h4>Learn by doing</h4>
            <p>Instead of long explainers up front, we showed people how to use it <em>while</em> they used it. Less confusion, more confidence.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 04 Screens -->
      <section class="section reveal">
        <div class="section-label"><span class="num">04</span><span>The screens</span></div>
        <h2 class="section-h">What it actually <em>looks like.</em></h2>
        <div class="prose"><p>Calm, dark, easy to read in any light. Built for everyday use.</p></div>

        <div class="screens-row cols-3">
          <div class="screen-card">
            <div class="frame"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dfim5nugc/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1400,c_limit/home_wvgkgd" alt="B home screen" / loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="meta"><div class="tag">Home</div><h4>One screen, everything you need</h4><p>A friendly hello, quick links, and a clear next step.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="screen-card">
            <div class="frame"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dfim5nugc/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1400,c_limit/gallery_w3ngcx" alt="Gallery" / loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="meta"><div class="tag">Gallery</div><h4>All your photos in one place</h4><p>What you captured today, sorted by date. Simple.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="screen-card">
            <div class="frame"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dfim5nugc/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1400,c_limit/buddy-chat_bhrizw" alt="Buddy chat" / loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="meta"><div class="tag">Buddy</div><h4>Hey there, how can I help?</h4><p>Type, talk, or ask anything. Buddy keeps it short.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="screens-row cols-3" style="margin-top:20px;">
          <div class="screen-card">
            <div class="frame"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dfim5nugc/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1400,c_limit/pairing_eqoxtk" alt="Pairing" / loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="meta"><div class="tag">Setup</div><h4>Say "Hey Buddy"</h4><p>The first step. Friendly and short.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="screen-card">
            <div class="frame"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dfim5nugc/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1400,c_limit/look-tell_u6m68y" alt="Nutrition" / loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="meta"><div class="tag">Nutrition</div><h4>"Hey Buddy, log my meal"</h4><p>Buddy captures the meal, analyses it, and gives back personal nutrition insights.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="screen-card">
            <div class="frame"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dfim5nugc/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1400,c_limit/settings_dxpl0g" alt="Settings" / loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="meta"><div class="tag">Settings</div><h4>Just enough controls</h4><p>Connected apps, audio, account. Plain words, not jargon.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="screens-row cols-2" style="margin-top:20px;">
          <div class="screen-card">
            <div class="frame"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dfim5nugc/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1400,c_limit/look-tell-main_n0jwwh" alt="Look and Tell main" / loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="meta"><div class="tag">Look &amp; Tell</div><h4>Ask about what you see</h4><p>Say "Hey Buddy, Look &amp; Tell" and Buddy describes what is in front of you, in plain language.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="screen-card">
            <div class="frame"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dfim5nugc/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1400,c_limit/look-tell-instructions_lqr14r" alt="How to use Look and Tell" / loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="meta"><div class="tag">Look &amp; Tell · How-to</div><h4>One screen, three steps</h4><p>Start, what happens, and how to stop. No jargon, no second guessing.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 05 Challenges -->
      <section class="section reveal">
        <div class="section-label"><span class="num">05</span><span>Where things broke</span></div>
        <h2 class="section-h">The product was good. <span class="accent">The category was new.</span></h2>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>People felt lost — not because the product was broken, but because nothing in their day looked like this. So confusion was the starting point. We had to design our way out of it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="challenge-list">
          <div class="challenge-card">
            <span class="n">01</span>
            <div>
              <p class="problem">People were confused — not because the product was bad, but because this kind of thing is new.</p>
              <p class="insight">↳ Smart glasses are not phones. There is no habit you can lean on.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="challenge-card">
            <span class="n">02</span>
            <div>
              <p class="problem">Ray-Ban Meta users picked it up fast. Most people don't come with that head start.</p>
              <p class="insight">↳ We couldn't design for the 5% who get it. We had to design for the 95% who don't.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="challenge-card">
            <span class="n">03</span>
            <div>
              <p class="problem">Some buyers came in out of pure curiosity, with no idea what to expect.</p>
              <p class="insight">↳ Curiosity is fragile. One bad moment kills it. Setup had to feel safe.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 06 Solutions -->
      <section class="section reveal">
        <div class="section-label"><span class="num">06</span><span>What actually worked</span></div>
        <h2 class="section-h">Help them <em>while</em> they use it. <em>Not before. Not after.</em></h2>
        <div class="solution-stack">
          <div class="solution-card feature">
            <span class="tag">The big unlock</span>
            <p>We swapped long explanations for live tutorials. People learned by doing, with small hints right where they needed them. Confusion dropped, comfort grew.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="solution-card">
            <span class="tag">Always testing</span>
            <p>We ran user tests again and again. Things that looked great in Figma but failed in real life got cut. The work was not adding — it was removing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 07 Learnings -->
      <section class="section reveal">
        <div class="section-label"><span class="num">07</span><span>What I carry forward</span></div>
        <h2 class="section-h">Lessons from designing <em>at the edge of new.</em></h2>
        <div class="takeaways">
          <div class="takeaway">
            <p class="quote">"Being clear matters more than being clever."</p>
            <p class="sub">When something is brand new, the first job isn't to impress. It's to help people find their feet.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="takeaway">
            <p class="quote">"If people don't get it in the first few minutes, they won't stay long enough to see the <em>good part.</em>"</p>
            <p class="sub">Every second of confusion is a person you've lost. The product can be amazing, but if setup fails, no one finds out.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="takeaway">
            <p class="quote">"A lot of things looked nice but didn't help. Those had to go."</p>
            <p class="sub">Letting go of work you like is part of the job. Real users don't care about your Figma file.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="page-next reveal">
        <a href="/" class="prev">
          <span class="k">← All work</span>
          <span class="v">Back to portfolio</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/case-smartband" class="next">
          <span class="k">Next case study</span>
          <span class="v">Smartband for Women</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</CaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  /* Lenskart brand — purple/violet accent overrides */
  .case-lenskart-page {
    --accent: #ADA8D4;
    --accent-ink: #BDB6E0;
    --brand: #8E8FFF;
  }
  html[data-theme="light"] .case-lenskart-page {
    --accent: #8073B5;
    --accent-ink: #6B5B9F;
    --brand: #6E63C9;
  }

  /* Brand atmospheric bloom */
  body::before {
    content: "";
    position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 55% at 50% -8%,
        color-mix(in oklab, #8E8FFF 22%, transparent) 0%,
        color-mix(in oklab, #8E8FFF 9%, transparent) 28%,
        transparent 62%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 38% at 85% 8%,
        color-mix(in oklab, #4A3A8E 18%, transparent) 0%,
        transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 40% at 12% 18%,
        color-mix(in oklab, #2E4A8E 12%, transparent) 0%,
        transparent 65%);
  }
  html[data-theme="light"] body::before {
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 55% at 50% -8%,
        color-mix(in oklab, #8E8FFF 12%, transparent) 0%,
        color-mix(in oklab, #8E8FFF 5%, transparent) 28%,
        transparent 62%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 38% at 85% 8%,
        color-mix(in oklab, #6E63C9 8%, transparent) 0%,
        transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 40% at 12% 18%,
        color-mix(in oklab, #4A6FA8 5%, transparent) 0%,
        transparent 65%);
  }
  .nav, main, .page, .to-top { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  /* NDA badge */
  .eyebrow .nda, .nav-meta .nda {
    padding: 3px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--warn); color: var(--warn);
    border-radius: 999px; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .nav-meta .nda { display: none; } }

  /* Page sub label */
  .page-sub {
    font-family: var(--f-sans); font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em; max-width: 40ch; margin-bottom: 28px; text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* Numbered list (lenskart size) */
  .num-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 32px 0 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
  .num-list li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px; font-size: 17px; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.6; }
  .num-list .n {
    flex: 0 0 36px; height: 36px; margin-top: 2px;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 50%, transparent);
    font-family: var(--f-sans); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--accent-ink);
  }

  /* Product grid */
  .product-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 32px; }
  .product-card { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg-2); border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; transition: border-color .3s, background .3s, transform .4s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1); }
  .product-card:hover { border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 50%, var(--line)); background: var(--bg-3); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .product-card .pn { font-family: var(--f-sans); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-ink); }
  .product-card .ps { font-family: var(--f-sans); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--fg-dim); font-style: italic; }
  .product-card h4 { font-family: var(--f-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.018em; color: var(--fg); margin-top: 2px; }
  .product-card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.65; }

  /* Screens grid */
  .screens-row { display: grid; gap: 20px; margin-top: 32px; }
  .screens-row.cols-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .screens-row.cols-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .screens-row.cols-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .screens-row.cols-2, .screens-row.cols-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .screen-card { border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--bg-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); transition: transform .4s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1), border-color .3s; }
  .screen-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--fg-dim); }
  .screen-card .frame { width: 100%; height: auto; background: var(--bg); overflow: hidden; padding: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .screen-card .frame img { width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: cover; object-position: top center; border-radius: 22px; }
  .screen-card .meta { padding: 14px 18px 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .screen-card .meta .tag { font-family: var(--f-sans); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-ink); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .screen-card .meta h4 { font-family: var(--f-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--fg); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .screen-card .meta p { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.55; }

  /* Challenge cards */
  .challenge-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; margin-top: 32px; }
  .challenge-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 36px 1fr; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 26px 28px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg-2); border-radius: 14px; transition: border-color .3s, background .3s, transform .4s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1); }
  .challenge-card:hover { border-color: var(--fg-dim); background: var(--bg-3); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .challenge-card .n { height: 36px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 50%, transparent); font-family: var(--f-sans); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--accent-ink); }
  .challenge-card .problem { font-family: var(--f-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--fg); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .challenge-card .insight { font-family: var(--f-sans); font-size: 13px; color: var(--accent-ink); letter-spacing: 0.02em; line-height: 1.55; opacity: 0.85; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .challenge-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; padding: 22px; } }

  /* Solution cards */
  .solution-stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; margin-top: 32px; }
  .solution-card { padding: 32px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; background: var(--bg-2); transition: border-color .3s, background .3s, transform .4s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1); }
  .solution-card:hover { border-color: var(--fg-dim); background: var(--bg-3); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .solution-card.feature { background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 6%, var(--bg-2)); border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 30%, var(--line)); }
  .solution-card .tag { font-family: var(--f-sans); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-ink); margin-bottom: 14px; display: inline-block; }
  .solution-card p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 60ch; }
  .solution-card.feature p { color: var(--fg); }

  /* Takeaways (shared pattern) */
  .takeaways { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; margin-top: 32px; }
  .takeaway { border-left: 1px solid var(--accent); padding: 22px 28px; background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 6%, var(--bg-2)); border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; transition: background .3s; }
  .takeaway:hover { background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 10%, var(--bg-2)); }
  .takeaway .quote { font-family: var(--f-display); font-weight: 320; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(19px, 2.1vw, 24px); line-height: 1.4; letter-spacing: -0.015em; color: var(--fg); margin-bottom: 10px; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .takeaway .quote em { color: var(--accent-ink); font-style: italic; }
  .takeaway .sub { font-size: 14px; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* Page nav */
  .page-next { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-top: 24px; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .page-next { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .page-next a { padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: var(--bg-2); transition: border-color .25s, transform .4s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1), background .25s; display: block; }
  .page-next a:hover { border-color: var(--fg-dim); transform: translateY(-2px); background: var(--bg-3); }
  .page-next .k { font-family: var(--f-sans); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--fg-dim); margin-bottom: 12px; display: block; }
  .page-next .v { font-family: var(--f-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--fg); line-height: 1.25; }
  .page-next a.next { text-align: right; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .page-next a.next { text-align: left; } }
</style>
